e where each participant can speak freely about their experiences. Third we will work together to draft a set of actionable recommendations that can be implemented in the coming weeks.\n\nThis is not a presentation. It is a conversation. There are no right or wrong answers. There is only truth and the courage to speak it. We are not here to assign blame or point fingers. We are here to grow together. We are here because we care about the future of this team and the success of every individual within it.\n\nWe understand that your time is valuable and we appreciate the effort you are making to join us. Please confirm your attendance by Friday the 6th so we can prepare seating materials and ensure that everyone has an opportunity to be heard. If you have any special needs or requests regarding accessibility or scheduling please let us know immediately.\n\nWe are not just meeting to talk about problems. We are meeting to build solutions. We are not just sharing data. We are sharing stories. We are not just identifying correlations. We are understanding the human experience behind them. You are not just a participant. You are a vital part of this journey.\n\nThank you for your dedication your insight and your commitment. We look forward to seeing you there and beginning this important conversation together.\n\nWarm regards\n\nThe Organizing Committee", "logprobs": [{"token": "Dear", "logprob": -0.03817349299788475}, {"token": " Team", "logprob": -0.26643526554107666}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.03683341294527054}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.008653167635202408}, {"token": " hope", "logprob": -0.014188366010785103}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -9.691245941212401e-05}, {"token": " message", "logprob": -3.0278701160568744e-05}, {"token": " finds", "logprob": -9.536697689327411e-06}, {"token": " you", "logprob": -0.001553520211018622}, {"token": " well", "logprob": -0.028513699769973755}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.028442444279789925}, {"token": " thriving", "l